        "text": "§\nWhat type of infections is TMP-SMX first line for?\n\n(1) UTI\n(2) Prostatitis\n\n(3) Nocardia\n\n(4) Pneumocystis jirovecci\n\n(Prophylaxis for Toxoplasma, NOT treatment)\n\n[Image: c094d0b299a4c11476bcbb81b10aad3f8aae258445932b92d11dcae48eee35a6]\n\n[Image: 5d7b3dee6b9f13b75bbf1f94c819544df574e5c58e7a8575bc4d376f2c02cdf7]\n\n[Image: e91ea95f47856aef63d8fb85286df03190e48b03e98ae9c7c4fa745cc000a227]\n\n[Image: a44de8e39b66dc44e0acbeccf6f623660a4d809ce7335bef7d8709bf8f06863e]\n\n4.1 - Trimethoprim/Sulfamethoxazole\n[Image: 37c2cd24e0dbf7e6dab13595c23d90bc2c210bdefbc5d2cdc2444e105608a9da]\n\n[Image: 415ae7ac37e8deff6edded3b983bc93ed29481d92586c3b4cd6b30e8cffdbcb9]\n\n[Image: 302471b7496c79a2f2bed549939836e9977f92a9a73671da6d63dbed58856d70]",
